            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a vacuum adiabatic body. The vacuum adiabatic body includes a supporting unit configured to maintain an inner vacuum space part and a pipeline disposed in the vacuum space part. A pipeline is spaced apart form a third space by the supporting unit, and movement of the pipeline in a horizontal direction is restricted by the supporting unit. According to an embodiment, a heat exchange pipeline through which a refrigerant flows may be stably supported by an interaction between the spacing member and the support unit.</p>
            </abstract>
